1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:36,041
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
Emei Day)

3
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:37,333
The Ministry of Rites reports:

4
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:38,999
(Heavenly Law Bureau in the Capital)
The ore supply for Yuyou's porcelain

5
00:00:38,999 --> 00:00:40,791
(Heavenly Law Bureau in the Capital)
kilns is running low again.

6
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:44,583
The half-monsters in the Undercity have
been working day and night in shifts,

7
00:00:44,958 --> 00:00:46,416
but it's still not enough.

8
00:00:46,708 --> 00:00:49,291
May we send another batch of workers?

9
00:00:50,583 --> 00:00:53,375
How many living sacrifices remain
in the Undercity?

10
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,000
The number of registered monster slaves

11
00:00:55,125 --> 00:00:57,041
is over 2,300.

12
00:00:57,916 --> 00:00:59,458
Which village has offered

13
00:01:00,333 --> 00:01:01,333
the least tribute this year?

14
00:01:01,625 --> 00:01:04,458
Shinian Village on the edge of Dazedi.

15
00:01:04,958 --> 00:01:06,750
Then withdraw their protection.

16
00:01:07,708 --> 00:01:08,833
Select the strongest ones

17
00:01:08,833 --> 00:01:09,958
and send them to the Undercity

18
00:01:10,333 --> 00:01:11,583
to ease the gods' burden.

19
00:01:12,291 --> 00:01:13,250
Yes.

20
00:01:14,166 --> 00:01:15,833
That boy from Dazedi,

21
00:01:16,916 --> 00:01:17,791
how is he?

22
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,541
He's been on the road for some time.

23
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:21,625
He should have reached Shitu Forest

24
00:01:21,625 --> 00:01:23,333
by now.

25
00:01:33,833 --> 00:01:34,541
Lili's weakness

26
00:01:34,541 --> 00:01:35,583
is about 3 cun below the neck,
[*8 centimeters]

27
00:01:35,583 --> 00:01:36,416
right in the center of its chest.

28
00:01:36,416 --> 00:01:36,916
Duo Mu,

29
00:01:36,916 --> 00:01:37,750
hold off its left side.

30
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:16,640
Hahaha!

31
00:02:26,333 --> 00:02:27,250
Yan!

32
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:28,208
Here it is!

33
00:02:40,208 --> 00:02:41,000
No!

34
00:02:50,583 --> 00:02:51,208
(Lili.)

35
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:53,166
(3 cun below the neck.)
[*8 centimeters]

36
00:02:53,791 --> 00:02:54,375
(One.)

37
00:02:54,625 --> 00:02:55,333
(Two.)

38
00:02:56,916 --> 00:02:57,833
(Three.)

39
00:03:09,666 --> 00:03:10,583
Kid,

40
00:03:10,875 --> 00:03:11,708
we told you to cover our rear,

41
00:03:11,708 --> 00:03:12,833
not strike it head-on.

42
00:03:13,291 --> 00:03:14,041
Do you know

43
00:03:14,291 --> 00:03:15,916
if your blade had missed by just a bit,

44
00:03:15,916 --> 00:03:18,208
it would've turned around and gored you.

45
00:03:18,375 --> 00:03:19,833
My aim never misses.

46
00:03:22,083 --> 00:03:22,958
Listen,

47
00:03:23,416 --> 00:03:24,416
this escort run

48
00:03:24,541 --> 00:03:25,916
is only to get you to the Capital.

49
00:03:26,250 --> 00:03:27,666
We don't have time to risk our lives
with you.

50
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,166
The Monster Wastes are deadly.

51
00:03:30,375 --> 00:03:31,708
If you keep acting recklessly,

52
00:03:31,875 --> 00:03:33,208
we won't be responsible for you.

53
00:03:33,208 --> 00:03:33,958
Enough.

54
00:03:33,958 --> 00:03:35,208
Stop arguing.

55
00:03:35,208 --> 00:03:36,208
My sister is still waiting for me.

56
00:03:36,625 --> 00:03:37,416
Is there any way

57
00:03:38,166 --> 00:03:39,708
to cross the Monster Wastes faster?

58
00:03:41,083 --> 00:03:41,916
Through Haogui Cave.

59
00:03:42,208 --> 00:03:43,166
It's the shortest route.

60
00:03:44,625 --> 00:03:45,166
Yan.

61
00:03:46,125 --> 00:03:47,333
There are many Haogui creatures there.

62
00:03:47,708 --> 00:03:48,500
If we provoke them,

63
00:03:48,666 --> 00:03:49,750
we may not survive.

64
00:03:53,708 --> 00:03:54,791
I have an idea.

65
00:03:56,208 --> 00:03:57,750
Haogui follow their young master.

66
00:03:58,250 --> 00:03:59,125
Wherever the young master goes,

67
00:03:59,125 --> 00:04:00,208
the Haogui follow.

68
00:04:00,916 --> 00:04:02,166
During the day, while they're asleep,

69
00:04:02,333 --> 00:04:03,875
we steal the young master

70
00:04:04,208 --> 00:04:05,166
and carry it away on a Bo beast.

71
00:04:06,083 --> 00:04:08,208
When the Haogui wake up,
they'll chase after it.

72
00:04:08,375 --> 00:04:09,958
We'll use that chance to pass through.

73
00:04:10,375 --> 00:04:10,791
Yan,

74
00:04:11,166 --> 00:04:11,958
it's up to you.

75
00:04:27,625 --> 00:04:29,666
So these are Haogui?

76
00:04:40,625 --> 00:04:41,625
Where is the young master?

77
00:04:42,916 --> 00:04:45,041
Haogui always leave the best spot
for their young master.

78
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:48,000
It should be on the highest stalactite.

79
00:05:00,875 --> 00:05:01,958
Someone took it.

80
00:05:01,958 --> 00:05:03,458
And it happened not long ago.

81
00:05:33,875 --> 00:05:34,416
What?

82
00:05:35,333 --> 00:05:36,791
Why did they leave?

83
00:05:38,375 --> 00:05:39,833
Forget it. We need to move.

84
00:05:40,333 --> 00:05:41,333
While the Haogui are gone,

85
00:05:41,333 --> 00:05:42,666
let's get through.

86
00:05:50,375 --> 00:05:51,583
Looks like we're lucky.

87
00:05:51,583 --> 00:05:52,458
I'll call the Bo here.

88
00:05:52,458 --> 00:05:53,708
We need to hurry.

89
00:05:54,250 --> 00:05:54,833
Wait.

90
00:06:02,833 --> 00:06:03,875
(East; Gathering)

91
00:06:15,708 --> 00:06:17,708
The Porcelain Armored Soldiers
are controlling the young master.

92
00:06:17,833 --> 00:06:20,208
The Porcelain Armored Soldiers
only serve the Capital.

93
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:22,041
Why would they be here?

94
00:06:22,458 --> 00:06:23,208
Duo Mu.

95
00:06:23,833 --> 00:06:25,125
Listen to what they're saying.

96
00:06:27,666 --> 00:06:31,625
(Food.)

97
00:06:31,833 --> 00:06:35,000
They said "food".

98
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:38,875
(Shinian Village.)

99
00:06:38,875 --> 00:06:40,333
The food is in Shinian Village.

100
00:06:41,375 --> 00:06:43,083
They're going to Shinian Village
to hunt.

101
00:06:45,291 --> 00:06:46,416
Not to hunt.

102
00:06:47,583 --> 00:06:48,166
It's...

103
00:06:48,167 --> 00:06:49,333
(East; Gathering)

104
00:06:49,458 --> 00:06:50,166
monsterization!

105
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,791
The Porcelain Armored Soldiers
are sending Haogui into the village

106
00:06:53,458 --> 00:06:54,458
to bite the villagers

107
00:06:54,791 --> 00:06:56,458
and infect them with monster aura,

108
00:06:57,041 --> 00:06:58,375
turning them into half-monsters.

109
00:07:01,958 --> 00:07:03,208
But Shinian Village

110
00:07:03,208 --> 00:07:04,666
is protected by Heaven's barrier.

111
00:07:05,458 --> 00:07:06,916
How could they get inside?

112
00:07:08,708 --> 00:07:09,333
Look.

113
00:07:17,916 --> 00:07:19,708
The protection has been withdrawn.

114
00:07:47,833 --> 00:07:48,416
Let's go.

115
00:07:50,791 --> 00:07:53,333
(Heaven punishment has come.)

116
00:07:53,583 --> 00:07:56,500
The gods are punishing us.

117
00:08:16,583 --> 00:08:17,958
They're here to hunt.

118
00:08:18,875 --> 00:08:19,916
The villagers are the prey.

119
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:22,000
Haogui are the hounds.

120
00:08:22,125 --> 00:08:24,041
The Porcelain Armored Soldiers
are the hunters.

121
00:08:24,583 --> 00:08:25,791
They withdrew the protection,

122
00:08:25,791 --> 00:08:26,916
lured the Haogui here,

123
00:08:26,916 --> 00:08:28,625
turned the villagers into half-monsters,

124
00:08:28,625 --> 00:08:30,083
and will take them back
to the Undercity.

125
00:08:30,375 --> 00:08:31,083
So,

126
00:08:31,416 --> 00:08:33,375
there was never any Heavenly punishment.

127
00:08:33,958 --> 00:08:36,166
It was all their scheme.

128
00:08:43,625 --> 00:08:45,125
We have to go.

129
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,375
The Haogui have finally been drawn away.

130
00:08:49,208 --> 00:08:51,166
This is our best chance
to leave Haogui Cave.

131
00:08:52,750 --> 00:08:53,833
But if we leave,

132
00:08:54,458 --> 00:08:55,333
what about them?

133
00:08:55,583 --> 00:08:56,625
You want to help them?

134
00:08:57,375 --> 00:08:58,041
How?

135
00:08:58,708 --> 00:09:00,083
There are thousands of Haogui.

136
00:09:05,666 --> 00:09:07,791
Your sister is still waiting for you.

137
00:09:11,625 --> 00:09:12,625
Xiaoyue.

138
00:09:20,625 --> 00:09:22,416
Help!

139
00:09:22,916 --> 00:09:25,750
Save us!

140
00:09:30,208 --> 00:09:31,041
Mother.

141
00:09:31,541 --> 00:09:34,458
Why did the gods take away
our protection?

142
00:09:34,708 --> 00:09:36,791
We must not have offered
enough devotion.

143
00:09:37,041 --> 00:09:38,250
The gods are angry.

144
00:09:38,500 --> 00:09:39,916
They're punishing us.

145
00:09:39,916 --> 00:09:42,708
But we gave them our finest grain.

146
00:09:42,958 --> 00:09:45,416
We gave them our winter furs.

147
00:09:45,416 --> 00:09:49,208
Even the hen that laid eggs
for our family.

148
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:52,291
We gave them everything we had.

149
00:09:52,416 --> 00:09:54,375
Why are the gods still angry?

150
00:10:24,083 --> 00:10:27,291
What does Redtail exist for?

151
00:10:41,292 --> 00:10:43,292
(For every child in this world)

152
00:10:44,375 --> 00:10:47,333
(to hold their own lives
in their hands.)

153
00:11:45,125 --> 00:11:45,708
Yan.

154
00:11:45,916 --> 00:11:46,625
What do you say?

155
00:11:47,041 --> 00:11:47,791
I'll follow your lead.

156
00:11:51,291 --> 00:11:52,166
Lu Yuanqing.

157
00:11:52,416 --> 00:11:53,875
Your life has already been pledged
to the agency.

158
00:11:54,041 --> 00:11:55,291
Until the escort is complete,

159
00:11:55,291 --> 00:11:56,666
no one takes you away.

160
00:11:57,916 --> 00:11:58,541
Yan.

161
00:11:58,541 --> 00:11:59,750
We can't keep fighting like this.

162
00:11:59,750 --> 00:12:01,250
There are too many Haogui.

163
00:12:01,833 --> 00:12:03,000
Take down the leader first.

164
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:05,708
The young master is controlling
the Haogui.

165
00:12:05,875 --> 00:12:06,666
Capture it,

166
00:12:06,666 --> 00:12:07,458
and the rest will scatter.

167
00:12:07,458 --> 00:12:07,833
Right.

168
00:12:07,833 --> 00:12:08,833
Clear a path for me.

169
00:12:26,208 --> 00:12:27,416
Come here, little one.

170
00:12:27,416 --> 00:12:28,458
I will play with you.

171
00:12:29,416 --> 00:12:31,500
(Who do you think you're
looking down on?)

172
00:12:50,292 --> 00:12:51,250
(East; Gathering)

173
00:12:53,041 --> 00:12:54,500
Leave the Porcelain Armored Soldiers
to me.

174
00:13:57,666 --> 00:14:00,041
(Miss, don't kill me.)

175
00:14:01,333 --> 00:14:04,000
(I want to go home.)

176
00:14:06,125 --> 00:14:09,083
(Go home!)

177
00:14:10,208 --> 00:14:13,166
(Go home!)

178
00:14:13,500 --> 00:14:17,375
(Go home!)

179
00:14:55,583 --> 00:14:56,416
That's it?

180
00:14:56,416 --> 00:14:57,958
You're not so tough after all.

181
00:15:03,166 --> 00:15:05,291
(It can revive?)

182
00:15:12,083 --> 00:15:12,791
Then what do we do?

183
00:15:13,458 --> 00:15:14,041
The back of its neck.

184
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:16,458
All the runes converge at the neck.

185
00:15:16,791 --> 00:15:18,500
(Made in Yuyou Village)
We must cut through its neck completely.

186
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:20,166
Only then will the runes disappear.

187
00:15:21,125 --> 00:15:21,750
I'll do it.

188
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:35,125
(Dust Rises, Duo Mu Awakens!)

189
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:51,375
(Wind Still, Yan Jiu Bind!)

190
00:15:57,125 --> 00:15:58,375
(Turbid Dragon.)

191
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:00,250
(Second Strike.)

192
00:16:01,708 --> 00:16:04,792
(Fish-Dragon Dance.)

193
00:16:06,916 --> 00:16:07,833
Lu Yuanqing.

194
00:16:18,958 --> 00:16:20,292
(Made in Yuyou Village)

195
00:16:30,958 --> 00:16:31,833
Kid.

196
00:16:31,958 --> 00:16:32,958
Nice teamwork.

197
00:16:32,958 --> 00:16:33,500
This is your reward.

198
00:16:38,583 --> 00:16:39,375
What's wrong with him?

199
00:16:44,916 --> 00:16:46,125
The monster aura is rebelling.

200
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:47,458
It's entered his heart meridians.

201
00:17:26,083 --> 00:17:27,041
Mother.

202
00:17:27,041 --> 00:17:28,541
Who are they?

203
00:17:30,916 --> 00:17:33,166
They saved us.

204
00:17:33,166 --> 00:17:36,125
Are they gods?

205
00:17:48,333 --> 00:17:49,166
Hey!

206
00:17:49,833 --> 00:17:51,291
(The Nameless)
Thank you!

207
00:17:51,291 --> 00:17:53,375
=Episode 3=
Heroes without names!
